    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 10.38,
      "end": 16.44,
      "text": "How about the lantern in the woods? A girl sees a light bobbing between the trees every night, and nobody believes her."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 19.86,
      "end": 24.88,
      "text": "One night she follows it and finds an old man looking for his lost dog. He's been searching for years."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 27.58,
      "end": 34.6,
      "text": "That's the twist. She helps him look, and at sunrise they find the dog, and both of them just fade away, happy. The light never comes back."
